<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/empire-of-japan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Empire%20of%20Japan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Empire of Japan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">US oil embargo in August pushes Japan towards the attack on Pearl Harbor</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/italian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Italian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Italian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">British and Commonwealth forces end Italian rule in East Africa; Haile Selassie returns</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/russian-sfsr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Russian%20SFSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Russian SFSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Germany invades; Leningrad is besieged and Moscow threatened</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-yugoslavia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Yugoslavia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Yugoslavia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Germany and its allies invade and the army surrenders on 17 April</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/soviet-union"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Soviet%20Union.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Soviet Union</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Germany invades the Soviet Union on 22 June</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/nazi-germany"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nazi%20Germany.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nazi Germany</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Operation Barbarossa: Germany invades the Soviet Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/haitian-vodou"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Haitian%20Vodou.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Haitian Vodou</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The government launches Operation Nettoyage, a Church-backed campaign to destroy many Vodou temples</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/mongolian"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mongolian.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mongolian</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Cyrillic is made mandatory in the Mongolian state, after a Latin alphabet adopted that year lasts two months</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/islamism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Islamism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Islamism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Abul A’la Maududi founds the Jamaat-e-Islami party</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/popol-vuh"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Popol%20Vuh.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Popol Vuh</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Adrián Recinos rediscovers the manuscript at the Newberry Library</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/haile-selassie"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Haile%20Selassie.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Haile Selassie</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He enters Addis Ababa on 5 May, exactly five years after the Italian forces had entered the city</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/independent-state-of-croatia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Independent%20State%20of%20Croatia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Independent State of Croatia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Slavko Kvaternik proclaims the Independent State of Croatia in Zagreb under German protection</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/independent-state-of-croatia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Independent%20State%20of%20Croatia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Independent State of Croatia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ante Pavelić returns from exile in Italy and takes power as Poglavnik</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/independent-state-of-croatia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Independent%20State%20of%20Croatia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Independent State of Croatia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Treaties of Rome cede central Dalmatia, most Adriatic islands and other lands to Italy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/independent-state-of-croatia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Independent%20State%20of%20Croatia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Independent State of Croatia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Sisak Partisan Detachment, celebrated as the first armed resistance unit in occupied Yugoslavia, is formed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/chamorro-people"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Chamorro%20people.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Chamorro people</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Japanese forces invaded Guam hours after the attack on Pearl Harbor</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-hungary-1920-1946"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Hungary%20(1920-1946).png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Hungary (1920-1946)</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hungary joins the invasion of Yugoslavia and, on 27 June, declares war on the Soviet Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/ho-chi-minh"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ho%20Chi%20Minh.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ho Chi Minh</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Returns to Vietnam to lead the Việt Minh independence movement against the Japanese occupation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/fall-of-singapore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Fall%20of%20Singapore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Fall of Singapore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Japanese 25th Army invades Malaya and Thailand, and Japanese aircraft sink the battleship Prince of Wales and the battlecruiser Repulse</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/kyiv"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kyiv.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kyiv</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Nazi Germany occupies the city, and nearly 34,000 Jews are killed at Babi Yar</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/saint-petersburg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Saint%20Petersburg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Saint Petersburg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">German forces begin the siege of Leningrad, which lasts until 1944</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/hong-kong"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hong%20Kong.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hong Kong</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Japan attacks Hong Kong on 8 December and the British surrender on 25 December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/addis-ababa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Addis%20Ababa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Addis Ababa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Haile Selassie returns to Addis Ababa five years to the day after he left</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/harar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Harar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Harar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Nigeria Regiment captures Harar from the Italians</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/honolulu"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Honolulu.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Honolulu</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Empire of Japan attacks nearby Pearl Harbor</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/rabindranath-tagore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rabindranath%20Tagore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rabindranath Tagore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Dies at Jorasanko on 7 August, aged 80</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/stalinism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Stalinism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Stalinism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Mass deportations of whole peoples begin, and by 1949 nearly 3.3 million people are deported</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/caodaism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Caodaism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Caodaism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Phạm Công Tắc and other Caodaist leaders are arrested and jailed in French penal colonies in Madagascar, where they stay until 1946</span></li></ul></section>
